<title>CANADA: Talisman CEO blasts Wascana projections.</title>
<headline>Talisman CEO blasts Wascana projections.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Talisman Energy Inc chief executive Jim Buckee came out swinging on Friday against Wascana Energy Inc's financial and operating projections, which have ignited the takeover target's stock.</p>
<p>In brisk, point-by-point fashion, Buckee outlined in a conference call why he questioned Wascana's financial outlook and sharply higher oil and gas reserve tally and why he believed investors should also be wary.</p>
</text>
